odel may not be used in datasets for, in the development of, or as inputs to generative AI programs.</strong></p>\n<p>Key Features:</p>\n<p>🪣 Charming Kitchen Ensemble: Features a kitchen counter set with a sink, marble countertop, and worn blue-painted wood, ready for your stove.</p>\n<p>🍽️ Versatile Placement: Ideal for enhancing the ambiance of kitchens, dining areas, or any setting that calls for a charming and functional kitchen setup.</p>\n<p>🪣 Realistic Detail: Meticulously designed to capture the weathered textures and vintage appeal of this charming kitchen counter set.</p>\n<p>Elevate the ambiance of your scenes with this charming worn blue kitchen counter set. Complete with a sink, marble countertop, and inviting worn blue-painted wood, this ensemble is ready for your stove. Perfect for adding character and vintage charm to kitchens, dining areas, or any setting that requires a charming and functional kitchen setup.</p>","isAiForbidden":false,"isAiGenerated":false,"lastUpdatedAt":"","listingType":"3d-model","media":"https://media.fab.com/image_previews/gallery_images/b037c53d-855c-4f99-bb2d-17b69abbb150/d91b8e49-f904-442e-b846-8f83b189dc98.jpeg","publishedAt":"2024-10-05T18:01:41.772491Z","reviewCount":4,"thumbnail":"https://media.fab.com/image_previews/gallery_images/98a5d122-656b-4ec1-9485-8ac02945e8f3/82bbfa10-b278-464d-86dd-cdd4f131d1b3.jpeg","title":"Blue Kitchen Marble Counter & Sink 🚰","uid":"c6dbea20-eeb9-45b5-9155-aa0deaf39f5d","updatedAt":"","user":{"coverImageUrl":"https://cdn1.epicgames.com/fab/seller/o-65q3mn6k9ws4szh7h8dq39272qbqtt/cover/6acb2c20.png","profileImageUrl":"https://cdn1.epicgames.com/fab/seller/o-65q3mn6k9ws4szh7h8dq39272qbqtt/profileImage/blob-500x500-002d54c6574722549ab9ee47c85fefd2.jpg","sellerName":"Glowbox3D","uid":"20891416-4d7f-4c66-b18c-9ba2979d955c"},"tags":[{"name":"Pbr","slug":"pbr","uid":"080edd3b-d10a-4f32-ace2-30f5baa480dc"},{"name":"Counter","slug":"counter","uid":"353fa9a6-1cbd-4f40-acc3-5e6cf0b1a654"},{"name":"D